WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:19.947
The T. rex stomped toward Metro City Elementary School.

2
00:00:19.948 --> 00:00:23.745
Roar! The entire school shook.

3
00:00:23.746 --> 00:00:30.083
The T. rex peered into a window.

4
00:00:30.084 --> 00:00:35.676
Terrell gulped. "I thought it would be cool to see real live dinosaurs.

5
00:00:35.677 --> 00:00:38.711
I don't think so anymore!"

6
00:00:38.712 --> 00:00:41.896
"Look at those teeth!" Jack cried.

7
00:00:41.897 --> 00:00:45.594
"I hope Rocket Girl comes soon!" said Mara.

8
00:00:45.595 --> 00:00:51.137
Suddenly—zoom! Roxy flew past the T. rex's head.

9
00:00:51.138 --> 00:00:54.011
"Rocket Girl!" cried Terrell.

10
00:00:54.012 --> 00:00:56.735
Roxy landed in the kickball field.

11
00:00:56.736 --> 00:01:04.129
"Hey, T. rex! Try to get me!"

12
00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:10.405
The T. rex roared and stomped toward Roxy.

13
00:01:10.406 --> 00:01:16.336
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams blasted a big hole in the ground.

14
00:01:16.337 --> 00:01:22.570
The T. rex tumbled into it. Roar!

15
00:01:22.571 --> 00:01:26.572
The dinosaur stomped around in the hole, trapped.

16
00:01:26.573 --> 00:01:31.256
Roxy was about to fly away when she noticed a jeep nearby.

17
00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:35.762
The man inside had a pair of binoculars and a safari hat.

18
00:01:35.763 --> 00:01:39.247
He was watching two tall dinosaurs eat leaves.

19
00:01:39.248 --> 00:01:41.771
"Hmm," thought Roxy.

20
00:01:41.772 --> 00:01:44.677
"I wonder who that man is."

21
00:01:44.678 --> 00:01:48.190
Just then the man looked at Roxy and gasped.

22
00:01:48.191 --> 00:01:52.218
He dropped the binoculars and drove off fast.

23
00:01:52.219 --> 00:01:55.858
"Now that is suspicious!" said Roxy.

24
00:01:55.859 --> 00:02:01.545
She blasted into the air and flew after the jeep.

25
00:02:01.546 --> 00:02:05.262
Roxy followed the jeep into the mountains.

26
00:02:05.263 --> 00:02:08.542
It soon arrived at a large mansion.

27
00:02:08.543 --> 00:02:15.877
The man jumped out of the jeep and ran inside.

28
00:02:15.878 --> 00:02:22.363
Whiz-hoo! Roxy blasted open the mansion's doors and went in.

29
00:02:22.364 --> 00:02:26.527
But she didn't see the man anywhere.

30
00:02:26.528 --> 00:02:29.260
Using her super hearing, she listened.

31
00:02:29.261 --> 00:02:32.443
Tick-tock, tick-tock, tick-tock.

32
00:02:32.444 --> 00:02:39.655
Roxy could hear many clocks, all ticking at once.

33
00:02:39.656 --> 00:02:44.977
Roxy followed the sounds to the basement.

34
00:02:44.978 --> 00:02:49.692
There she found a laboratory full of clocks, watches, and calendars.

35
00:02:49.693 --> 00:02:53.239
The man with the safari hat stood before a giant clock.

36
00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:59.527
Instead of hours and minutes, years and centuries marked the clock.

37
00:02:59.528 --> 00:03:02.414
"How did you get in here?" asked the man.

38
00:03:02.415 --> 00:03:06.291
Roxy didn't answer. "Who are you?" she asked.

39
00:03:06.292 --> 00:03:08.685
The man folded his arms.

40
00:03:08.686 --> 00:03:11.614
"I'm Professor Flashback," he said.

41
00:03:11.615 --> 00:03:14.087
"And I'm time traveling."

42
00:03:14.088 --> 00:03:17.106
"Time traveling?" asked Roxy.

43
00:03:17.107 --> 00:03:20.227
"Yes," said Professor Flashback.

44
00:03:20.228 --> 00:03:23.526
"I wanted to study real live dinosaurs.

45
00:03:23.527 --> 00:03:27.959
So I made Metro City travel millions of years into the past."

46
00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:32.323
"Well, you have to return the city to the present," said Roxy.

47
00:03:32.324 --> 00:03:35.949
"Dinosaurs are destroying everything!"

48
00:03:35.950 --> 00:03:39.123
"Hmm," said Professor Flashback.

49
00:03:39.124 --> 00:03:43.005
"The present is so . . . boring.

50
00:03:43.006 --> 00:03:46.083
Let's go to the Stone Age instead!"

51
00:03:46.084 --> 00:03:48.762
He reached for the clock's hand.

52
00:03:48.763 --> 00:03:53.276
"No!" said Roxy. "You can't just—"

53
00:03:53.277 --> 00:03:56.714
Smash! The laboratory door burst open.

54
00:03:56.715 --> 00:04:03.525
Dinosaurs swarmed inside!
